{"unit_id": "tag:01NR:statement", "translation": "在情形<REF_0001>中，态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>（见引理<REF_0002>）带有下列附加结构。\n存在一个拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的、按<MATH_0002>分次（graded）的<MATH_0003>-代数（algebras）层（sheaf）<MATH_0004>，以及一个分次（graded）<MATH_0005>-代数（algebras）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>。它们由下列性质唯一确定：对每个满足条件的仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0007>，其中<MATH_0008>，都存在一个同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0009>，它是按<MATH_0010>分次（graded）的<MATH_0011>-代数（algebras）之间的同构，使得<MATH_0012>交换（commutative）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "commutative", "target_term": "交换"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指所引用引理中的态射。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "说明代数层的拟凝聚性。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "首次说明代数层的分次。"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指构成分次层的代数。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "指引理构造的拟凝聚分次代数层。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "指态射所涉及的代数的分次。"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指所给态射涉及的分次代数。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指附加结构中的分次代数态射。"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "指唯一确定附加结构的性质所量化的开集。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "指在给定仿射开集上存在的分次代数同构。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "说明同构两端代数的分次。"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指该同构两端的分次代数。"}, {"source_term": "commutative", "target_term": "交换", "context": "说明所显示的图表是交换的。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01NR:proof", "translation": "我们将利用引理<REF_0001>，把按<MATH_0001>分次（graded）的代数（algebras）层（sheaves）<MATH_0002>（对应于<MATH_0003>及仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0004>）在概形（scheme）<MATH_0005>上粘合（glue）起来。所需的数据已在引理<REF_0002>中构造，而引理<REF_0003>的条件（d）已在引理<REF_0004>中验证。因此，我们得到按<MATH_0006>分次（graded）的<MATH_0007>-代数（algebras）层（sheaf）<MATH_0008>，以及同构（isomorphisms）<MATH_0009>，后者对应于所有仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0010>和所有<MATH_0011>。\n对每个仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0012>，若<MATH_0013>，便有一个映射（map）<MATH_0014>。因此，由相对粘合（glueing）的函子性（functoriality），映射（map）<MATH_0015>存在，见注记<REF_0005>。按构造，引理中的图表（diagram）交换（commutes）。\n这刻画了按<MATH_0016>分次（graded）的<MATH_0017>-代数（algebras）层（sheaf）<MATH_0018>，因为引理<REF_0006>的证明表明，要求这些图表（diagrams）交换（commute），就唯一确定了映射（maps）<MATH_0019>。略去一些细节。\n", "allowed_english": ["d"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "glue", "target_term": "粘合"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合"}, {"source_term": "functoriality", "target_term": "函子性"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "diagrams", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "commute", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "指待粘合的各代数层的分次。"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指构成待粘合各层的分次代数。"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "指需要在基底概形上粘合的各层。"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "指第一句中给出待粘合对象的开集。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指进行粘合所依托的概形。"}, {"source_term": "glue", "target_term": "粘合", "context": "相对构造中合成各局部层的操作。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "指经粘合得到的代数层的分次。"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指所得层的分次代数结构。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "指由局部对象粘合得到的层。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构", "context": "指与所得层一同得到的各个同构。"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "指所得各同构所对应的开集。"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "指在所给条件下有局部映射的开集。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指每个满足所给条件的仿射开集上的映射。"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合", "context": "指在此应用函子性的相对粘合构造。"}, {"source_term": "functoriality", "target_term": "函子性", "context": "指用于推出映射存在的相对粘合的性质。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指由相对粘合的函子性得到的映射。"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表", "context": "指引理中显示的图表。"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换", "context": "说明引理中的图表按构造交换。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "指由这些图表交换所刻画的代数层的分次。"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指被刻画的层的分次代数结构。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "指由所述交换条件刻画的分次代数层。"}, {"source_term": "diagrams", "target_term": "图表", "context": "指其交换性唯一确定各映射的多个图表。"}, {"source_term": "commute", "target_term": "交换", "context": "指用于唯一确定各映射的条件。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指由这些图表交换所唯一确定的各个映射。"}], "notes": []}
